From 55484eb86f496fa034ac5e4449a2514fd3454432 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: netplay <netplay@localhost>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 21:46:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] NE2000 network card from upstream PR #238 (georgemog, not
 merged)

From MiSTer-devel/ao486_MiSTer pull request #238 "Add NE2000 network card"
by georgemog (github.com/georgemog/ao486_MiSTer, branch ne2000-nic, b58abdb),
put on master 628ddbc without changes. The device core is the Minimig-AGA
Ethernet_shmem2 NE2000/RTL8019AS (apolkosnik/Minimig-AGA_MiSTer 9598b936, GPL)
with the Amiga bus renamed to a generic host port; I/O and IRQ wired into
rtl/system.v; frames go through a 64 KB shared window in DDR3 (0x1FF00000),
the core's DDR3 port shared with the CPU through a fixed-priority arbiter.
sim/iverilog/ne2000: the PR's test benches; sw/nettest: its DOS test tools.
Not built in Quartus and not tried on hardware by the PR.

NE2000_AO486_PLAN.md (the PR's design record) is left out: it holds its
author's machine names and paths; read it in the PR.
